    "prompt": "The chart below shows the average number of bicycles parked per day in the shared parking area at Maple Grove Station in 2023, 2024 and 2025, divided into morning (7-10 am) and evening (5-8 pm). Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. This is original practice material, not an official test question. Data: 2023 - morning 120 bicycles, evening 95 bicycles; 2024 - morning 165 bicycles, evening 140 bicycles; 2025 - morning 210 bicycles, evening 195 bicycles. The parking area has 230 marked spaces. Write at least 150 words in about 20 minutes.",
