    "focus": "Comparing recruitment channels by response, eligibility and enrolment",
    "prompt": "This is an original practice task. You should spend about 20 minutes on this task. The table below shows the recruitment plan and early outcomes for a Westfield University project on sleep and study habits in February 2025. The team aimed to enrol 120 first-year undergraduates. Channel | Students contacted | Responses received | Eligible after screening | Finally enrolled: Direct email invitation | 800 | 132 | 68 | 54 | Brief announcement in lectures | 600 | 98 | 61 | 48 | Posters in library and dormitories | contacts estimated 450 | 41 | 22 | 15 | Student society social media posts | contacts estimated 900 | 76 | 28 | 19. Screening excluded students working night shifts and those already in another sleep study. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. Write at least 150 words.",
    "minimumWords": 150,
