    "pathwayStage": "band-5",
    "focus": "Discussing two views and giving a clear opinion with examples",
    "prompt": "Some people think universities should organise a welcome picnic for new students at the start of each year. Others think it is not necessary and students can meet each other in other ways.\n\nDiscuss both views and give your own opinion. Give reasons for your answer and include any relevant examples from your own knowledge or experience.\n\nWrite at least 250 words.",
