    "pathwayStage": "band-6",
    "focus": "Paraphrasing numbers and comparing activities with linked ideas",
    "prompt": "The table below shows information about four activities at a Museum Family Learning Day held at Riverside Museum on 16 March 2024. It shows the number of families, the total number of participants, and the average satisfaction rating (out of 5) for each activity.\n\nPottery Workshop: 42 families, 118 participants, rating 4.6\nStorytelling Tour: 55 families, 142 participants, rating 4.8\nScience Discovery Lab: 38 families, 105 participants, rating 4.3\nArt Trail Challenge: 48 families, 130 participants, rating 4.5\n\nSummarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. You should write at least 150 words in about 20 minutes.",
    "minimumWords": 150,
