    "skill": "Writing",
    "task": "Task 1 · City Park Volunteer Rota Hours",
    "pathwayStage": "band-6",
    "focus": "Describing linked data and correcting details in comparisons",
    "prompt": "The table below shows the total volunteer hours recorded for three tasks in Greenfield City Park from January to April 2024.\n\nTask | January | February | March | April\nPlanting and Gardening | 20 hours | 25 hours | 40 hours | 35 hours\nLitter Collection | 30 hours | 28 hours | 32 hours | 30 hours\nGuiding Visitors | 15 hours | 18 hours | 22 hours | 30 hours\n\nSummarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.\nWrite at least 150 words.",
