    "focus": "summarising comparative data with qualified claims and noting study limitations",
    "prompt": "You should spend about 20 minutes on this task. The table below shows results of a pilot mentoring programme for first-year undergraduates in the Faculty of Science at Westfield University, 2023-2024. It compares 120 students who volunteered for mentoring with 150 students who did not. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. Write at least 150 words. Data: Mentored group (n=120) – Retention to Year 2: 89%, Average GPA (4.0 scale): 3.2, Reported high satisfaction: 78%, Average meetings with advisor per month: 2.4. Non-mentored group (n=150) – Retention to Year 2: 76%, Average GPA: 2.9, Reported high satisfaction: 52%, Average meetings per month: 0.8. Note: Participants self-selected; results apply only to one faculty and one academic year.",
