    "pathwayStage": "band-6",
    "focus": "linked ideas and clear comparisons with data",
    "prompt": "You should spend about 20 minutes on this task. The table below shows the number of active pairs taking part in the Greenfield University Language Exchange Programme in three semesters. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. Write at least 150 words.\n\nGreenfield University Language Exchange – Active Pairs by Language Pairing:\nSpring 2023: English-Spanish 45, English-Japanese 30, English-Arabic 20, Total 95\nAutumn 2023: English-Spanish 60, English-Japanese 35, English-Arabic 25, Total 120\nSpring 2024: English-Spanish 70, English-Japanese 50, English-Arabic 30, Total 150\n\nThe programme pairs a native speaker of one language with a learner of that language. Numbers show active pairs per semester.",
