    "task": "Task 2 · Funding for Bicycle-Safety Events",
    "pathwayStage": "band-6",
    "focus": "paraphrase, linked ideas and evaluation of views",
    "prompt": "You should spend about 40 minutes on this task. Some people think cities should spend more public money on bicycle-safety events and training for all age groups. Others think individuals should be responsible for their own safety and that money should be used for roads and public transport instead. Discuss both views and give your own opinion. Write at least 250 words.",
