    "pathwayStage": "band-6",
    "focus": "clear comparisons, linked ideas and corrected details",
    "prompt": "You should spend about 40 minutes on this task. At many universities, students can join a language exchange where they teach their own language to a partner and learn their partner's language in return. Some people argue this is more effective than traditional classroom language courses. Others say classroom teaching is more reliable and structured. Discuss the advantages and disadvantages of both methods and give your opinion. Write at least 250 words.",
