    "task": "Task 2 · Library Local-History Exhibits",
    "pathwayStage": "band-6",
    "focus": "paraphrase, linked ideas and reasoned evaluation",
    "prompt": "You should spend about 40 minutes on this task. Many public libraries organise local-history exhibits with photographs, documents and objects from the community. Some people say this is an important use of library space and funds. Others believe libraries should focus mainly on digital resources and quiet study areas. To what extent do you agree or disagree? Write at least 250 words.",
    "minimumWords": 250,
